<title>USA: Xavier delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Xavier delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xavier Corp said on Tuesday that the Nasdaq Listing Qualifications Panel delisted the company's shares, effective May 23, 1997.</p>
<p>Xavier said it intends to reapply after it files its 1996 annual report and meets market capitalization requirements.</p>
<p>The company's status with the Alberta Stock Exchange will be re-evaluated once Xavier is in compliance with its filing requirements, Xavier said.</p>
<p>In the interim period, the company will pursue a listing on the OTC Bulletin Board, the company said.</p>
